        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heavy fuel oil, burned in power plant
Emissions, materials use, infrastructure, etc. for oil input to power plants;
UUID: b6a55971-2410-309f-9689-c4aba393bb27
All energy use, use of chemicals, emissions to air and water including treatment of flue gasses and effluents.
Location: Estimation for the country.
Technology: Estimation for average technology.
Time period: Some data for 2000, other data for Europe.
Production volume: 0.2 TWh from power plants and 3.9 TWh from combined cycle plants.
Sampling: Questionnaire 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b6a55971-2410-309f-9689-c4aba393bb27.xml</text>
